            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors have analyzed the results of clinico-instrumental examination of patients with a neurodystrophic form of lumbar ischialgia associated with lumbar osteochondrosis and specified two groups of symptoms: (1) due to pathogenetic manifestations of the disease and (2) due to sanogenetic reactions of the body.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
